    date "2021-05-03T23:00:06Z"
    title "Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas: Too much adrenochrome (HD CLIP)"
    description "What&#8217;s happening in this Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas movie clip?&#10;Their trips mostly over, Gonzo (Benicio Del Toro from Traffic) deals with Lucy over the phone (pretending that he is being savagely beaten by thugs) as Duke (Johnny Depp from Edward Scissorhands, Arizona Dream and Pirates of the Caribbean) attempts to mellow out by trying some of Gonzo's stash of adrenochrome. &#10;&#10;Rent or buy  Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas here: https://amzn.to/34xfroC &#10;&#10;What&#8217;s the  Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas movie about? &#10;In 1971, the journalist Raoul Duke (Johnny Depp from Edward Scissorhands, Arizona Dream and Pirates of the Caribbean), accompanied by his lawyer, Mr. Gonzo (Benicio del Toro from Traffic), was on his way to Las Vegas because he was assigned to cover a major sporting event, the 400 miles of Las Vegas. But this report is only a pretext because Duke and Gonzo took a whole range of drugs with them. When they arrive at the hotel, Duke is in the middle of an acid surge and his hallucinations draw attention to him. One morning, Duke discovers that Gonzo has flown to Los Angeles. Faced with the damage and the astronomical bill, Duke flees by car. Duke calls Gonzo and Gonzo informs him that he has booked a suite for them at the Flamingo Hotel to cover a police narcotics convention. Duke and Gonzo then go to the convention but can't make it and return to their suite. Gonzo gets Duke to try adrenochrome, then they engage in a frenzy of various drugs, with Duke remembering only scattered memories. Duke takes Gonzo to the airport and returns to the hotel to finish his article. He then returns to Los Angeles.&#10;&#10;Credits: &#169; 1998 Universal Pictures&#10;&#10;Like this video if you want to see more episodes and tell us what you thought in the comments below.&#10;&#10;Don't forget to turn on notifications to catch our next videos!&#10;&#10;Keep up with us on Facebook!&#10;&#10;Binge Society | https://www.facebook.com/BingeSociety/&#10;Binge Society - Action | https://www.facebook.com/binge.society.action/&#10;Binge Society - Comedy | https://www.facebook.com/binge.society.comedy/&#10;&#10;Binge Society brings you the best of your favorite movies and TV shows! Here you will find iconic scenes, moments, and lines from all the films, characters, celebrities and actors you love. As movie fans, we give you content we know you will enjoy!&#10;&#10;&#10;#fearandfloathinginlasvegas #comedy #drama #johnnydepp #movieclip #beniciodeltoro #drugs #high #absurd"
    channeltitle "Binge Society "
