    description "Sisters Of Mercy tribute album &#8220;Black Waves Of Adrenochrome &#8211; The Sisters Of Mercy Tribute&#8221;&#10;&#10;get set for a Sisters Of Mercy tribute album ... it is titled &#8220;Black Waves Of Adrenochrome &#8211; The Sisters Of Mercy Tribute&#8221; out on June 26th through Metalville Records. .. it will include covers from Cradle Of Filth, Paradise Lost, Kreator and more ... see below..&#10;&#10;01 &#8211; Frown &#8211; &#8220;Heartland&#8221;&#10;02 &#8211; Atrocity &#8211; &#8220;More&#8221;&#10;03 &#8211; In Extremo &#8211; &#8220;This Corrosion&#8221;&#10;04 &#8211; Paradise Lost &#8211; &#8220;Walk Away&#8221;&#10;05 &#8211; Cradle Of Filth &#8211; &#8220;No Time To Cry&#8221;&#10;05 &#8211; Deadlock &#8211; &#8220;Temple Of Love&#8221;&#10;06 &#8211; Nevergreen &#8211; &#8220;More&#8221;&#10;07 &#8211; Maryslim &#8211; &#8220;This Corrosion&#8221; (feat. Jyrki69)&#10;08 &#8211; Daeonia &#8211; &#8220;Alice&#8221;&#10;09 &#8211; Kreator &#8211; &#8220;Lucretia My Reflection&#8221;&#10;10 &#8211; Cadaverous Condition &#8211; &#8220;Floorshow&#8221;&#10;11 &#8211; Dan Swan&#246; &#8211; &#8220;Lucretia My Reflection&#8221;&#10;12 &#8211; Dreadful Shadows &#8211; &#8220;1959&#8221;&#10;13 &#8211; Crematory &#8211; &#8220;Temple Of Love&#8221;&#10;14 &#8211; CO Box &#8211; &#8220;Marian&#8220;&#10;&#10;Sisters Of Mercy tribute album &#8220;Black Waves Of Adrenochrome &#8211; The Sisters Of Mercy Tribute&#8221;"
