    date "2020-07-12T13:48:23Z"
    title " Adrenochrome Witch Horror Story"
    description "A gentleman trying to get away from it all spends the night in a local motel with plenty of vacancies.  However, his room is not the only one occupied, and his noisy neighbors are there to enjoy something far more insidious than rest and relaxation &#10022; New 2020 Creepypasta Scary Story Reading &#10;&#10;&#128218; READ ALONG ON OUR HORROR FICTION WEBSITE CREEPYPASTASTORIES.COM:&#10;https://www.creepypastastories.com/the-ophidian-motel/&#10;&#10;&#128273; CTFDN PATRONS - DOWNLOAD THIS STORY AD-FREE NOW:&#10;https://www.chillingtalesfordarknights.com/patrons-area/chilling-tales-for-dark-nights/the-ophidian-motel/&#10;&#10;What is adrenochrome? Where does adrenochrome come from? Are celebrities using adrenochrome? Adrenochrome uses, adrenochrome conspiracies via the Qanon community, follow the white rabbit. Are celebrities suffering from adrenochrome withdrawal, what does adrenochrome do, the truth about adrenochrome is scary, is adrenochrome consumption safe, is there any truth to the adrenochrome witch book, are adrenochrome coronavirus related, Are Tom Hanks, Marina Abramovic, Ellen Degeneres and Madonna using adrenochrome?  Effects of adrenochrome consumption allegedly include anti-aging. Do adrenochrome images exist? &#10;&#10;&#128101; MORE OF AUTHOR SETH PAUL:&#10;https://www.creepypastastories.com/authors/seth-paul/&#10;&#10;&#128276; SUBSCRIBE TO OUR CHANNELS &#38; ENABLE NOTIFICATIONS:&#10;&#10022; Otis Jiry's Horror Storytime: https://bit.ly/2SOu1Fe&#10;&#10022; Chilling Tales for Dark Nights: https://bit.ly/35NFXfG&#10;&#10;Get more information about this and our other programs on our websites:&#10;https://www.chillingtalesfordarknights.com&#10;https://www.simplyscarypodcast.com&#10;&#10;&#128266; Subscribe to the Chilling Tales for Dark Nights podcast today:&#10;&#10022; Apple Podcasts: http://bit.ly/ChillingTalesPodApple&#10;&#10022; Spotify: http://bit.ly/ChillingTalesPodSpotify&#10;&#10022; Stitcher: http://bit.ly/ChillingTalesPodStitcher&#10;&#10022; Google Podcasts: http://bit.ly/ChillingTalesPodGoogle&#10;&#10;CREDITS&#10;&#34;The Ophidian Motel&#34;&#10;Written by Seth Paul&#10;Narrated by Erik Peabody&#10;Produced by Craig Groshek&#10;Music by Luke Hodgkinson &#38; Jesse Cornett &#10;&#10;&#129499; MORE OF NARRATOR ERIK PEABODY:&#10;&#10022; Evil Idol Profile: https://www.chillingtalesfordarknights.com/evilidol2019/contestants/erik-peabody/&#10;&#10022; More Narrations on YouTube: https://bit.ly/2DtvOuw&#10;&#10022; Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/VikingGuitar/&#10;&#10022; Twitter: https://twitter.com/vikingguitar&#10;&#10;Patrons, download hundreds of creepypasta stories &#8227; https://www.chillingtalesfordarknights.com/join/&#10;&#10;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#10;PATRONS &#8213; DOWNLOAD ALL THESE STORIES AD-FREE: https://bit.ly/2Ctn5UX&#10;Sign up &#8227; https://www.chillingtalesfordarknights.com/join/&#10;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#9481;&#10;&#10;Submit your own story for production!&#10;&#9658; submissions [at] chillingtalesfordarknights.com&#10;&#10;Recommended Playlists:&#10;&#9658; Compilations: https://bit.ly/2FEsGvC&#10;&#9658; Full-Cast Audio Dramas: https://bit.ly/2swjvFc&#10;&#9658; Nightmare Fuel Individual Stories: https://bit.ly/2FLLhW7&#10;&#10;More FREE spooky stories:&#10;&#9658; Spotify: https://bit.ly/2FQ2n5h&#10;&#9658; Simply Scary Podcasts: https://bit.ly/2AW3hcX&#10;&#9658; Official CTFDN Website: https://www.chillingtalesfordarknights.com&#10;&#10;Follow us on social media:&#10;&#9658; Facebook: https://bit.ly/2Mm4X3Z&#10;&#9658; Twitter: https://bit.ly/2T891HS&#10;&#9658; Instagram: https://bit.ly/2RPAhxp&#10;&#9658; Amazon: https://bit.ly/2ASr4us&#10;&#10;Chilling Tale