    id 82
    name "110"
    label "EKMtE62aTpI"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-04T14:04:51Z"
    title "ADRENOCHROME - In the Dream"
    description "Lyric video for Adrenochrome - In the Dream&#10;&#10;Adrenochrome is an essence, a state of mind, a choice, to play and create exciting and passionate music.&#10;In early 2019 Alfio Caracciolo (Drums) called Mattia Maniezzo (Bass) and Simone Romanato (Voice and guitar) to let them hear a few tracks he made. After a few listening to his tracks, the very next month they joined the band, they rolled up their sleeves and they became: Adrenochrome.&#10;&#10;Influenced by Queen, The Darkness, Muse and many other,&#10;they eat and drink music every moment they breathe,  because for them, Rock 'n' roll is not dead.&#10;&#10;PLEASE SUBSCRIBE TO STAY UPDATED&#10;&#10;FOLLOW US ON: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/adrenochromeofficialband/&#10;https://open.spotify.com/album/5ensJ3N1cG2IRviQRntnfK&#10;http://itunes.apple.com/album/id1612417510?ls=1&#38;app=itunes&#10;http://itunes.apple.com/album/id/1612417510&#10;&#10;LYRICS&#10;Yeah, I&#8217;m feeling good.&#10;Even Today I didn&#8217;t sell myself.&#10;Lately I&#8217;m feeling down,&#10;I need to buy some stuff to feel good.&#10;&#10;I&#8217;m busy, I&#8217;m lazy, I&#8217;m crazy. (That&#8217;s right.)&#10;I&#8217;ll fix my face, I need some caffeine.&#10;I should put on something cool,&#10;I found my pants, I got what I need.&#10;&#10;It isn&#8217;t right, could be wrong, It isn&#8217;t wrong, could be right.&#10;It isn&#8217;t right, could be wrong, It isn&#8217;t wrong, could be right.&#10;&#10;Two ladies, already at the party tonight.&#10;I&#8217;m going to taste their lips,&#10;otherwise I know, how to have fun alone,&#10;I got my stuff on my in 5 and baby I could be gone!&#10;&#10;Oh yeah!&#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t care of the people saying.&#10;They live a normal life, they live in paradise.&#10;Maybe it&#8217;s me, I&#8217;m in the dream.&#10;&#10;It isn&#8217;t right, could be wrong, &#10;It isn&#8217;t wrong, could be right.&#10;It isn&#8217;t right, could be wrong, &#10;It isn&#8217;t wrong, could be right.&#10;&#10;It isn&#8217;t right, could be wrong, &#10;It isn&#8217;t wrong, could be right. &#10;It isn&#8217;t right, could be wrong, &#10;It isn&#8217;t wrong, could be right."
